          "body": "(deftest test-gen-parse-long\n  (let [res (chk/quick-check\n              100000\n              (prop/for-all* [gen/large-integer]\n                #(= % (-> % str parse-long))))]\n    (if (:result res)\n      (is true) ;; pass\n      (is (:result res) (pr-str res)))))",
